<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets call warrants on HK Telecom.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on HK Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Friday it would issue 450 million American style call warrants on shares of HK Telecommunication Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$17.15     PREMIUM	 16.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2761    GEARING	 6.21x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 30.MAY.97    LISTING DATE  25.JUN.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  29.MAR.98    PAYDATE	 23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> NOTE		  STOCK DELIVERY OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT THE</p>
<p>OPTION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
